{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06386","headline":"琴歌 · 李颀","name":"琴歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主人有酒欢今夕，请奏鸣琴广陵客。\n月照城头乌半飞，霜凄万树风入衣。\n铜鑪华烛烛增辉，初弹渌水後楚妃。\n一声已动物皆静，四座无言星欲稀。\n清淮奉使千余里，敢告云山从此始。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》卷一三三、《唐诗鉴赏辞典》李颀条（上海辞书出版社，1983）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"刘学锴"}